# Pixie GTK — do not work around this

Chat POC builds **always** use `PIXIEWOOD_USE_PIXIE=1` (`build-chat-poc-apk.sh`).

When pixie is on:

- **Do not** check out, patch, or edit GTK in this repo (`subprojects/gtk`, `gtk-subproject-bootstrap`, `gtkimcontextandroid.c`, or any `android-bugs` / IME patch files — removed; chat uses pixie only).
- **Do not** add bypass flags or unset pixie on chat scripts.
- **Do** fix GTK/IME via Knowles pixie packages and `resolve-pixie-gtk-pins.sh` / `fetch-pixie-deps.sh`.

Source GTK compile is **only** via `build-source-diff-apk.sh` (pixie unset). If `refuse-gtk-subproject.sh` or `refuse-pixie-source-hack.sh` stops the build, read the warning and fix pixie pins — do not circumvent the check.